### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### About check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/about

### GET all assets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets

### Get one asset
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets/A002

### Get one asset that doesn't exist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/assets/23232

### Create a valid asset
POST http://localhost:8080/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "assetTag": "",
    "name": "",
    "category": "",
    "serialNumber": "",
    "status": "",
    "location": ""
  }

### Get All Tickets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets

### Get one ticket
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/T001

### Get one ticket that doesn't exist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/T999

### Create valid ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "VPN connection not working",
  "description": "User cannot connect to company VPN from home.",
  "category": "Network",
  "priority": "MEDIUM",
  "createdBy": "siti@example.com"
}

### Create invalid ticket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "",
  "category": "",
  "priority": "",
  "createdBy": ""
}